	(text "FULL ADDER for this bit: P = A xor XB, S = P xor Cin, Cout = A.XB + P.Cin (G = NAND(A, XB) is also NOT (A and XB); A or XB = NAND(NOT P, G)).  Cin is SUB on bit 0, the carry from the card below on the others; Cout goes to the card above over the link."
